131:T9f3,![](/images/cms/a9gfbrsg-129d0x2-ppw-7da9e4.webp)

## Mobile and fast plastic identification

Thanks to trinamiX's portable handheld device, plastics can be identified directly on-site and within seconds – even without an internet connection. This user-friendly solution significantly enhances the safety and transparency of your material flows.

![](/images/cms/trx-devices-mockup-plastics0-web-v4-40d279.webp)

## Benefits of the trinamiX solution

- **Fast and reliable**: Plastic identification in seconds.
- **User-friendly**: Easy handling for anyone.
- **Safety**: Improve your goods receipt control with reliable on-site identification of various plastics.
- **Transparency**: Our customer portal enables the documentation, visualization, and analysis of incoming and outgoing waste streams.

## Improved decision-making through NIR spectroscopy

With the trinamiX PAL One mobile NIR spectrometer solution, the invisible is made visible, significantly improving on-site decision-making.

How the trinamiX Mobile NIR Spectroscopy device works:

![](/images/cms/a9r2c53h-129d0wt-ppw-14470c.webp)

## Wide range of identifiable plastics

The trinamiX solution can reliably identify a wide range of over 30 plastics, including:

**- Thermoplastics**: PLA, PA, POM, PB, PBT, PPSU, PI, HDPE, LDPE, PP, PVC, PS, PEEK\
**-** **Blends and specialty polymers**: ABS-PA, PC-ABS, SBS/SEBS, PC, SAN, PU, PET-A, ASA, ABS, PET-G, PAI, PPS, PMMA, PVDF, PEI, PESU, PSU, PE/PP blends\
**- Films**: Mono-material and multi-material films

*(Carbon-black plastics cannot be detected.)*

![](/images/cms/a9r9jdib-129d0x4-ppw-2024-10-17-104320-p-c2c57f.webp)

## Technical Specifications

The trinamiX Mobile NIR Spectroscopy solution offers a compact and powerful solution for measurement and analysis, seamlessly integrating into digital environments.

- **Battery capacity** for up to 6,000 measurements
- **Compact size**, slightly larger than a smartphone
- **Wireless connection** via Bluetooth® to smart devices and internet connectivity to the customer portal
- **Data storage** in the MS Azure Cloud (provided by BASF SE)
- **End-to-End encryption** (SSL, AES 256)
- **Compatible with Android, iOS, and Windows**
- **Customer portal** for advanced analysis
- Utilizes **proprietary chemometric models**

For more information on trinamiX Mobile NIR Spectroscopy technology, please visit [**here**](https://trinamixsensing.com/plasticsorting)or feel free to contact your trinamiX representative Mr. [**Adrian Vogel**](/partners/trinamix/) at any time.132:"$EObject.defineProperty(function remarkGfm(options) {\n    // @ts-expect-error: TS is wrong about `this`.\n    // eslint-disable-next-line unicorn/no-this-assignment\n    const self = this;\n    const settings = options || emptyOptions;\n    const data = self.data();\n    const micromarkExtensions = data.micromarkExtensions || (data.micromarkExtensions = []);\n    const fromMarkdownExtensions = data.fromMarkdownExtensions || (data.fromMarkdownExtensions = []);\n    const toMarkdownExtensions = data.toMarkdownExtensions || (data.toMarkdownExtensions = []);\n    micromarkExtensions.push((0, __TURBOPACK__imported__module__$5b$project$5d2f$node_modules$2f$micromark$2d$extension$2d$gfm$2f$index$2e$js__$5b$app$2d$rsc$5d$__$28$ecmascript$29$__[\"gfm\"])(settings));\n    fromMarkdownExtensions.push((0, __TURBOPACK__imported__module__$5b$project$5d2f$node_modules$2f$mdast$2d$util$2d$gfm$2f$lib$2f$index$2e$js__$5b$app$2d$rsc$5d$__$28$ecmascript$29$__[\"gfmFromMarkdown\"])());\n    toMarkdownExtensions.push((0, __TURBOPACK__imported__module__$5b$project$5d2f$node_modules$2f$mdast$2d$util$2d$gfm$2f$lib$2f$index$2e$js__$5b$app$2d$rsc$5d$__$28$ecmascript$29$__[\"gfmToMarkdown\"])(settings));\n},\"name\",{value:\"remarkGfm\"})"
